        <br/>
        &bull; <strong>Causality & Prediction:</strong> Instrumental variable techniques (Mendelian Randomization) test causal hypotheses, while PRS and neural sequence models (Borzoi, AlphaGenome, GPN-Star) bridge statistical association to molecular function.
      </p>
