              <td><Katex tex="N \le 20,000" /></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>BOLT-LMM (Loh et al. 2015)</strong></td>
              <td>Monte Carlo REML + Conjugate gradient solving without explicitly storing <Katex tex="\mathbf{A}" />.</td>
              <td><Katex tex="O(M_{\text{GRM}} N \times \text{iterations})" /></td>
              <td><Katex tex="N \approx 500,000" /> (UK Biobank scale)</td>
